  "timing_context": "The 30-frame timing sample uses the full graphics-suite fixture settings; it is not an FPS benchmark of every default graphics option.",
  "visual_review": "All 36 native region renders reviewed, plus town, woodland, river, snow and desert gameplay-scale day/night/rain views. Initial overly smooth tonal patches revised to quiet irregular pixel edges and grouped vegetation. Existing snow coverage and cave geometry preserved.",
  "scope": "Presentation only. No original map, collision, encounter, core/save-format or player-save changes. Isolated test saves only; no packaging or live-game navigation.",
  "audio_preview": "24-second offline preview: meadow day, meadow night, desert day, river day, each six seconds at in-game 65% master mix levels. Source clips, gain/filter recipe and provenance retained; not microphone-recorded gameplay.",
  "simplify_review": "Reviewed task-relative diff: one existing-renderer partial for cached ground, bounded plants and local habitat queries; shared two-voice nature mixer; no generic biome framework, persistent state or simulation objects. Test fixtures render all regions and cover visibility, secret aliases, RNG, audio lifecycle and original town route access.",
